cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this model, please cite this software release and the accompanying
  paper.
type: software
title: "ChiEFT: a phenomenological chiral effective field theory model of pion production for neutrino event generators"
version: 1.0.0-rc1
date-released: 2026-10-29
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.23767016
license: GPL-3.0-only
repository-code: "https://github.com/AchillesGen/ChiEFT"
abstract: >-
  A FeynRules model and UFO 2.0 output of a phenomenological chiral effective
  field theory of pion production, built from nucleons, pions, and the
  Delta(1232) with gauge-invariant couplings and vertex-level form factors,
  together with a Sherpa form-factor plugin and the pipeline that produces the
  figures of the accompanying paper (free-nucleon photoproduction and
  neutrino-induced pion production, and nuclear predictions with Achilles and
  NUISANCE).
keywords:
  - neutrino
  - pion production
  - chiral effective field theory
  - Delta resonance
  - event generator
  - FeynRules
  - UFO
  - Sherpa
  - Achilles
